# Cloudflare serves the repo root as static files. Only publish index.html and Assets/.
# Everything else (server code, config, package files, backups) stays private.
*
!index.html
!Assets/
!Assets/**
# Original full-size videos are local only; the site uses Assets/Videos/web/.
Assets/Videos/*.mp4
Assets/Videos/*.mov
**/desktop.ini
**/Thumbs.db
